# SpanBay: build output, tool caches, local state and editor noise.
# Invariant: no rule may shadow a tracked file — `git ls-files -ci --exclude-standard` stays empty.

# ── Rust / Cargo ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# One workspace, one target dir. Keep Cargo.lock tracked.
target/
*.profraw
*.profdata
lcov.info

# ── Logs and local databases ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-journal
*.sqlite3-shm
*.sqlite3-wal
# `<db>.secrets` vault written beside a locally redirected database
*.secrets

# ── Env and signing material ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12

# ── Local tooling state ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.superpowers/
.cache/
.turbo/

# ── OS and editors ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

**/.overhaul
